# Dart Analysis Configuration Rules

## Base Configuration

• Include flutter_lints package rules
• Enable strict language features
• Exclude generated code files
• Configure strong-mode settings
• Disable implicit casts and dynamics

```yaml
include: package:flutter_lints/flutter.yaml

analyzer:
  language:
    strict-casts: true
    strict-inference: true
    strict-raw-types: true
```

## File Exclusion Patterns

• Exclude all generated Dart files
• Skip Freezed generated files
• Ignore build and tool directories
• Exclude part files from analysis
• Skip auto-generated configuration files

```yaml
analyzer:
  exclude:
    - "**/*.g.dart"
    - "**/*.freezed.dart"
    - "**/*.gr.dart"
    - "**/*.config.dart"
    - "**/*.part.dart"
    - "build/**"
    - ".dart_tool/**"
```

## Strong Mode Configuration

• Disable implicit casts completely
• Prevent implicit dynamic usage
• Enforce explicit type declarations
• Require strict type checking
• Enable all strong-mode features

```yaml
strong-mode:
  implicit-casts: false
  implicit-dynamic: false
```

## Error Prevention Rules

• Always use package imports
• Avoid dynamic call patterns
• Prevent empty else statements
• Block relative lib imports
• Catch unrelated type equality

```yaml
linter:
  rules:
    - always_use_package_imports
    - avoid_dynamic_calls
    - avoid_empty_else
    - avoid_relative_lib_imports
    - unrelated_type_equality_checks
```

